        "TileImage": "$($repository 87ab7e2c-cdae-4566-b32e-75bc9cea84fd).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning 47,\r\rPut down your fries and pick up a burger, we have several targets ready to be barbecued!\rTake the disguise of the BBQ Owner, and blow two undercover agents sky high, then take out the corrupt politician, whose views are going to break this country. And while you’re at it, make sure you kill the BBQ Owner’s wife, she of all people will find the body.\r\rGood Luck 47!",
